                    <div class="flip-card-front">
                        <img src="~/Images/animated-icon/electro.gif" alt="Electro Mechanical">
                        <h4>Electro-Mechanical</h4>


                    </div>
                    <div class="flip-card-back">
                        <p>
                            We provide reliable electro-mechanical system solutions, integrating electrical and mechanical technologies for efficient and automated operations.
                            Our services ensure high performance, safety, and long-term reliability for industrial and commercial applications.
                        </p>
                        @*<a href="#" class="service-btn">More</a>*@
